Carry table-level options through the CDC schema-evolution path.

CdcSchema gains table-level options. The create and evolve paths stop
discarding them, or emit SchemaChange.setOption, so the source-type
annotations that leg 2 writes reach the Paimon table. RichEventParser counts
an option-only change as a change: since Paimon 1.2 it returns null when
nothing changed, and an option-only change was dropped silently.

Moved from getlago/lago-infrastructure images/flink-paimon/patches/, where the
classes were recompiled over the released jar. images/flink-paimon/README.md
there explains why this channel is needed and how test/run.sh covers it.

